SUMMARY:Open Mic @ One World Brewing Downtown
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nLet’s check out the Open Mic a
 t One World Brewing in downtown Asheville! Asheville has no shortage of ta
 lented musicians\, so the open mics around here rarely disappoint.\n\nWe
 ’ll meet at 7:00 PM. If you’d like to perform\, sign-up starts at 6:30
  PM. I’m not sure exactly when the music begins\, but it will probably b
 e around 7:30–8:00 PM\, giving us a little time to grab a drink and get 
 to know each other beforehand.\n\nCome to perform\, support the local musi
 cians\, or just meet some new people and enjoy the music!
